ntent.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/6y3zli1mp9y48zo/38553c68-2acb-4ff6-9c50-5af63fe22604/4a7d2440-5207-11f1-af7d-734b282814df/file-6y3zli1mp9y48zp.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\">","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"<p><b>X</b> is used for sterilizing drinking water.</p>"},{"identifier":"B","content":"<p><b>Y</b> has a planar structure.</p>"},{"identifier":"C","content":"<p><b>Z</b> is used in the enrichment of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.587ex\" height=\"1.887ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -833.9 1143.7 833.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(33,363) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>U.</p>"},{"identifier":"D","content":"<p><b>Y</b> is a stronger Lewis base than ammonia.</p>"}],"correct_options":["A","C"],"answer":null,"explanation":"<p><img alt=\"JEE Advanced 2026 Paper 1 Online Chemistry - p-Block Elements Question 2 English Explanation\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/6y3zli1mpb6s1fq/c659e1cf-360f-4129-9170-e7aa24fa767b/f1c19570-52b5-11f1-98ef-83dd5248c7a0/file-6y3zli1mpb6s1fr.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/6y3zli1mpb6s1fq/c659e1cf-360f-4129-9170-e7aa24fa767b/f1c19570-52b5-11f1-98ef-83dd5248c7a0/file-6y3zli1mpb6s1fr.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;max-height:40vh;vertical-align:baseline\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/6y3zli1mpb6s1fq/c659e1cf-360f-4129-9170-e7aa24fa767b/f1c19570-52b5-11f1-98ef-83dd5248c7a0/file-6y3zli1mpb6s1fr.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/6y3zli1mpb6s1fq/c659e1cf-360f-4129-9170-e7aa24fa767b/f1c19570-52b5-11f1-98ef-83dd5248c7a0/file-6y3zli1mpb6s1fr.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/6y3zli1mpb6s1fq/c659e1cf-360f-4129-9170-e7aa24fa767b/f1c19570-52b5-11f1-98ef-83dd5248c7a0/file-6y3zli1mpb6s1fr.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/6y3zli1mpb6s1fq/c659e1cf-360f-4129-9170-e7aa24fa767b/f1c19570-52b5-11f1-98ef-83dd5248c7a0/file-6y3zli1mpb6s1fr.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/6y3zli1mpb6s1fq/c659e1cf-360f-4129-9170-e7aa24fa767b/f1c19570-52b5-11f1-98ef-83dd5248c7a0/file-6y3zli1mpb6s1fr.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/6y3zli1mpb6s1fq/c659e1cf-360f-4129-9170-e7aa24fa767b/f1c19570-52b5-11f1-98ef-83dd5248c7a0/file-6y3zli1mpb6s1fr.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<p><b>(A)</b> Compound <u>X</u> is used for sterilizing drinking water.</p>\n<p>Chlorine gas (<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"3.25ex\" height=\"1.934ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 1436.6 855\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use><use data-c=\"6C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6C\" transform=\"translate(722,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1033,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>) is widely used as a disinfectant in water treatment. It kills harmful bacteria and microorganisms, making the water safe for drinking.</p>\n<p><b>(B)</b> Compound <u>Y</u> is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.947ex\" height=\"1.97ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 2186.6 870.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4E\"></use><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\" transform=\"translate(750,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"6C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6C\" transform=\"translate(1472,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1783,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> which has a pyramidal shape.</p>\n<p>This is because the nitrogen atom has one lone pair of electrons. Due to the repulsion between the bond pairs and lone pair, the molecular shape becomes pyramidal (similar to <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.381ex\" height=\"1.92ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 1936.6 848.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4E\"></use><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\" transform=\"translate(750,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1533,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>).</p>\n<p><b>(C)</b> Compound <u>Z</u> is used in the enrichment of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.05ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.284ex\" height=\"1.937ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -833.9 1893.7 855.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(33,363) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(1143.7,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"55\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-55\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>.</p>\n<p>Chlorine trifluoride (<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.727ex\" height=\"1.97ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 2089.6 870.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use><use data-c=\"6C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6C\" transform=\"translate(722,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"46\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-46\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1686,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>) is a very strong fluorinating agent. In the nuclear industry, it converts uranium into uranium hexafluoride (<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.162ex\" height=\"1.92ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 1839.6 848.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"55\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-55\"></use><use data-c=\"46\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-46\" transform=\"translate(750,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1436,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"36\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-36\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>). This compound is important in the gaseous diffusion or centrifugation process used to separate <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.05ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.284ex\" height=\"1.937ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -833.9 1893.7 855.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(33,363) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texc